    "description": "Authored a Python script utilizing Quandl API to gather commodity prices. Using Luigi tasking, script would gather at “end of market” and present the prices through a PostgreSQL database, complete with views of the commodity prices by date. This enabled financial advisors to suggest to clients to buy or sell commodities with the latest information\n\nImplemented a Python web scraper with Beautiful Soup to collect and parse data from third-party sources to detect internal data misrepresentations. Enabled company to have the latest, correct data for making strategic investments in missing oil wells in the PostgreSQL database.\n\nCreated an automated image processing analysis through a Ubuntu server utilizing AWS S3 to store and analyze MP4 videos. This DB equipped senior management with the latest data to make strategic investments.",
