    "title": "Stock Analysis",
    "description": "Python web scraping script to gather prices from Yahoo Finance Daily, this is a passion project and still in progress\n\nTables collected are Commodities, Currencies, Cryptocurrences, and Most Active Stocks\n\nAWS Lambda is triggered daily to perform the scrape and insert into an AWS RDS table for analysis\n\nA React application is in development to present the data for the users to make investment decisions as well as visualizing the stocks over a period of time",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2020 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "StoryTeller",
    "description": "Python and React web application enabling users to upload documents to manipulate and visualize data\n\nUtilizes many AWS modules such as S3 for user data and files, Lamdas for documentation upload and Textract for document extraction\n\nUsers can use their uploaded data from S3 to visualize their data and present to senior management and clients\n\nContent can be extracted from a CSV, Excel Spreadsheet or extracted from PDF via AWS Textract",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Dec 2019 - Present"
